Closed-form Ricci tensor components (2,3), (3,3): pure polynomial identities modulo k1^2+k2^2+k3^2 = 1 and W (r^2 + a^2 k3^2) = 1.
The development is split into parts only so that each piece compiles within the platform limits.
-/
